ls the \\\"window\\\" it counted in\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It names the cap and the tier as well\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It names the cap and the tier as well\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"it does the same on the 503 path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A 200 wants nothing\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 429 wants the stated wait\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-019\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 500 may be retried once that wait has passed\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-020\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 503 is the overload path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-021\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"fifty times the default allowance\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-022\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"measured over exactly the same window, not as a separate counting scheme\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-023\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The tier is set on the credential when it is issued\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-024\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"and cannot be asked for per call\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-025\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The gateway refuses a request for three reasons\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-026\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"and only one of them is the one above\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-027\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A credential may be suspended\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-028\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a route may be closed for maintenance\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-029\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit and be refused before it has been read at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-030\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"None of those three clears itself by waiting for a stated number of seconds\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-031\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-032\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-033\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"they are answered within two working days\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-034\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"There is no expedited path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-035\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"and no exception list\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"When that cap is spent the gateway answers 429 at the edge\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"without waking the service behind it\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"An earlier draft of this note argued for a client-side token bucket that mirrored the gateway's own counters\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"that section was left out on purpose\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Requests are counted against the credential that presented them, over a fixed window of 60 seconds whose start the gateway doesn't disclose, and never against a connection\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"over a fixed window of 60 seconds\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"whose start the gateway doesn't disclose\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"since the count follows the credential wherever it goes, including across hosts\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A client spread across eight worker processes is throttled at exactly the point one process would have been\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The default allowance is 100 requests in a window\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The refusal carries a Retry-After header\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Its value is a whole number of seconds to wait\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"and it is present on every refusal the gateway sends\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The body of the refusal is JSON\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"it names what the gateway calls the \\\"window\\\" it counted in. It names the cap and the tier as well\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The body naming window, cap and tier supports the claim it repeats these as fields.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Four rules, given in the order they should be applied\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"and it does the same on the 503 path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"even though the cause of the refusal there is an entirely different one\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-019\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A 200 wants nothing\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-020\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 429 wants the stated wait\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-021\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 500 may be retried once that wait has passed\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-022\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 503 is the overload path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Overload path entails the platform being overloaded.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-023\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A batch credential is allowed 1000 requests in a window\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-024\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"fifty times the default allowance\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-025\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The window, the header and the body are identical to the interactive case\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-026\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"so a client written for one tier needs no change at all to run against the other\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-027\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Nothing else about the two tiers differs in any way\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-028\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Log every refusal seen\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-029\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"and keep the log for at least a week\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-030\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The gateway refuses a request for 